  "text": "The NPDM 2021–2025 is distinctive for its integration with national development and climate agendas, its focus on disability-inclusive disaster risk management, and its emphasis on urban risk governance. It includes phased, prioritized actions through 2025 and promotes risk governance and accountability. The plan also highlights the role of the private sector in resilience building and aligns with international frameworks to ensure coherent disaster risk management.",
  "section_title": "Key Highlights",
